{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning everyone. I'm Maj. Rowan, Maintenance Control Officer. I need to begin the quarter-end property reconciliation for the items currently tagged as unserviceable — battery packs, rugged tablets, power converters, and electronic test cables. Per policy, I need to confirm current technical status and disposition recommendations with the responsible sections before I sign the disposition order. Could the property office, repair bench, and calibration desk each provide their current status and recommendations for these items so we can proceed?"}
```

