{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Good morning, Major. Regarding the six unserviceable battery packs: the battery shop confirmed this morning that all six have swollen casings covered by a manufacturer safety bulletin. They must be quarantined rather than repaired. We have property-office pickup scheduled for Wednesday at 1000. I should note that the inspection sheet is still in the shop binder and has not yet been entered in the maintenance control log — we'll get that entered so your records are complete before you sign the order."}
```

