{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Good morning, Major. I need to provide the current technical status and disposition recommendation for the rugged tablets. IT support completed certified data erasure on all eight rugged tablets and found them serviceable for the training cell. They must be reissued to the training cell with an asset transfer scheduled for Friday at 0900. I should note that the data erasure certificates are filed in the IT ticket system but have not been attached to the reconciliation packet — I'll make sure those are included before you sign the order."}
```

